OL,3,GNEWSASpeedboat killer jailed for attack
OL,4,Aon ex-partner
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2018 he was originally jailed for 10
OL,7,Fyears for manslaughter over the death
OL,8,Fof 24-year-old Charlotte Brown when his
OL,9,Fspeedboat crashed during a first date.
